FL,320,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31902
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F319A1786576712
OL,3,CAstronomers reveal photos of glasses
OL,4,Cused to view eclipse in 1927
OL,6,FThe red and black rectangular glasses
OL,7,Fcame with a book of instructions along
OL,8,Fwith an Ordnance Survey map showing
OL,9,Fthe areas of totality in England, the
OL,10,Fsociety said.
OL,12,FMeanwhile, experts have warned that
OL,13,Fonly special solar eclipse glasses
OL,14,Fthat are ISO 12312-2 certified for the
OL,15,Fsafest eye protection should be used
OL,16,Fto view Wednesday's eclipse and that
OL,17,Fsunglasses were not sufficient.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/9
