PN,31903
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F319A1786576712
OL,3,CAstronomers reveal photos of glasses
OL,4,Cused to view eclipse in 1927
OL,6,FFollowing the 1999 total solar
OL,7,Feclipse, the Royal College of
OL,8,FOphthalmologists reported around 70
OL,9,Fcases of people experiencing vision
OL,10,Fproblems after watching the eclipse,
OL,11,Fwith around 40% having looked at it
OL,12,Ffor less than a minute.
OL,14,FThe images from the Royal Society were
OL,15,Freleased on Wednesday along with
OL,16,Fothers of photographic glass plates
OL,17,Ftaken of a total solar eclipse in 1875.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/9
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
