PN,31904
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F319A1786576712
OL,3,CAstronomers reveal photos of glasses
OL,4,Cused to view eclipse in 1927
OL,6,FThe plates have been returned by the
OL,7,Fsociety to the Royal Astronomical
OL,8,FSociety in London after being
OL,9,Frediscovered in an archive.
OL,11,FThey include images captured by 23-
OL,12,Fyear-old physicist Arthur Schuster who
OL,13,Fjoined a Royal Society expedition to
OL,14,FThailand, then known as Siam, to view
OL,15,Fthe eclipse.
OL,17,FThe looming eclipse has seen people
OL,18,Ftravel for miles to get their hands on
OL,19,Fa pair of eclipse glasses ahead of the
OL,20,Fevent on Wednesday evening.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/9
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
