PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F319A1786576712
OL,3,CAstronomers reveal photos of glasses
OL,4,Cused to view eclipse in 1927
OL,6,FConvenience stores, national parks and
OL,7,Fthe Royal Greenwich Society have all
OL,8,Fexhausted their eclipse glasses supply
OL,9,Fahead of what will be the UK's fullest
OL,10,Feclipse for the next 54 years.
OL,12,FThe Royal Greenwich Observatory said
OL,13,Fit had sold approximately 15,000 pairs
OL,14,Fof eclipse glasses, selling out, in
OL,15,Fthe last month.
OL,17,FIt has also sold out tickets to their
OL,18,Fviewing event, but will offer a free
OL,19,Fviewing live stream on its website and
OL,20,Fon YouTube.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/9
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
