PN,31906
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F319A1786576712
OL,3,CAstronomers reveal photos of glasses
OL,4,Cused to view eclipse in 1927
OL,6,FA convenience store in Whitechapel had
OL,7,Fto turn away scores of customers
OL,8,Fhoping to get the specialist glasses,
OL,9,Fwith its owner, Ali Raza, saying
OL,10,Fcustomers had been travelling far and
OL,11,Fwide to get a pair.
OL,13,FRaza, who owns the AM2PM store, said:
OL,14,F"On Sunday we had people coming from
OL,15,FSurrey, Southend-on-Sea, yesterday
OL,16,Fnight a lady came from Southampton,
OL,17,Fand loads of people have come from
OL,18,FBirmingham as well. We're too busy.
OL,26,@vD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/9
