OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F319A1786576712
OL,3,CAstronomers reveal photos of glasses
OL,4,Cused to view eclipse in 1927
OL,6,F"Today I already sold 6,000 pairs. At
OL,7,F2.30 am we had a delivery from Spain,
OL,8,Fand by 9.30 am we sold out everything."
OL,10,FMore than 90% of the sun will be
OL,11,Fobscured by the moon between 6.17 pm
OL,12,Fand 8.06 pm on August 12 ` the most it
OL,13,Fhas been blocked in the UK since the
OL,14,Ftotal eclipse in 1999.
