OL,3,CAstronomers reveal photos of glasses
OL,4,Cused to view eclipse in 1927
OL,6,FIn the UK, Devon, Cornwall and the
OL,7,Fwesternmost parts of Pembrokeshire in
OL,8,FWales are set to see the eclipse at
OL,9,Fits fullest, with a range of 94% to
OL,10,F96% of the sun obscured by the moon.
OL,12,FExperts have warned that only special
OL,13,Fsolar eclipse glasses that are ISO
OL,14,F12312-2 certified for the safest eye
OL,15,Fprotection should be used to view the
OL,16,Feclipse.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G8/9
